  "translation": "Gomme Yahwe a re go Satane: Na o beile pelo ya gago go mohlanka wa ka Ijobo? Ka gobane go se na yo a swanago le yena lefaseng — motho yo a phethagaditswego le yo a lolametswego, yo a tšabago Elohim, gomme a fapoga le bobe.",
